<https://github.com/john1hsu/chess-graph/id/italian-game> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An open game beginning 1.e4 e5 2.Nf3 Nc6 3.Bc4, in which White develops the bishop to c4 to aim at f7; it covers the Giuoco Piano and Pianissimo (3...Bc5), the Evans Gambit and the Two Knights Defence." .
