<https://github.com/john1hsu/chess-graph/id/touch-move> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The rule of over-the-board chess that a player on the move who deliberately touches one of their own pieces must move it, and who touches an opponent's piece must capture it, if that is legal; pieces may be adjusted without obligation only after announcing \"j'adoube\" or \"I adjust\"." .
