<https://github.com/john1hsu/chess-graph/id/zugzwang> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A position in which the obligation to make a move is a disadvantage: the side to move would get a better result if it could pass. When this holds for both sides at once it is a mutual zugzwang, and the result depends only on whose turn it is." .
